sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as Client App / Llama Stack
    participant Proxy as Operator Route / Auth Proxy<br/>443/TCP HTTPS (platform TLS)
    participant Server as Guardrails Server<br/>8000/TCP HTTP (no TLS, no in-app auth)
    participant Rails as In-process Rails<br/>Presidio, YARA, HF/ONNX classifiers
    participant LLM as Main / Rails LLM<br/>MAIN_MODEL_BASE_URL (HTTP/HTTPS)
    participant Provider as Provider /models endpoint
    participant OTel as OTLP Collector<br/>4317/4318 gRPC/HTTP

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 1: Guarded chat completion
    Client->>Proxy: POST /v1/chat/completions<br/>HTTPS 443, platform-defined auth<br/>X-Authorization: Bearer LLM token
    Proxy->>Server: Forward HTTP 8000<br/>No encryption, no in-app auth
    Server->>Rails: Input rails (jailbreak/injection,<br/>PII, content safety, topic control)
    Rails-->>Server: Allow / block / mask
    Server->>LLM: OpenAI-compatible request<br/>TLS if https<br/>Bearer = env API key or X-Authorization
    LLM-->>Server: Completion
    Server->>Rails: Output rails
    Rails-->>Server: Allow / block / mask
    Server-->>Proxy: Guarded response (HTTP)
    Proxy-->>Client: JSON response (HTTPS)

    Note over Client,LLM: Flow 2: Guardrail-only check
    Client->>Server: POST /v1/checks or /v1/guardrail/checks<br/>HTTP 8000, no in-app auth
    Server->>Rails: Run configured rails (no generation)
    Server->>LLM: LLM-based rails (if configured)<br/>Bearer env key / X-Authorization
    LLM-->>Server: Rail verdict
    Server-->>Client: Check result (+ Deprecation/Sunset headers on legacy path)

    Note over Client,Provider: Flow 3: Model listing
    Client->>Server: GET /v1/models<br/>Authorization header (not validated)
    Server->>Provider: GET /models<br/>Bearer = env key, ELSE inbound Authorization forwarded
    Provider-->>Server: Model list
    Server-->>Client: Model list

    Note over Server,OTel: Flow 4: Telemetry (only if OTEL_EXPORTER_OTLP_ENDPOINT set)
    Server->>OTel: OTLP traces/metrics<br/>no auth configured
